#
# The author's own published name, in the package that names him as author: the
# manifest, the LICENSE, and the bundled copy of the manifest inside dist. All
# three are deliberate and belong in a published package.
#
# Scoped to the FULL name rather than each surrounding line. Three shapes of the
# same fact already exist — `"author": "..."` in JSON, `author: "..."` in the
# bundle where the key loses its quotes, and a copyright line — and a bundler
# reformatting its output would invent a fourth. Exempting the line shapes is
# whack-a-mole; exempting the full name is the actual exception, and it stays
# narrower than the pattern it answers, which is a bare three letters that also
# appear inside this name.
